<p class="lede">
This page lists, in date order, what the city and county records say about St. George Crossing in Waynesboro and the Sylvan Road rezoning in Atlanta. Wording of motions and results is the record's own. Draft minutes are marked draft, and minutes not yet posted are marked not posted.
</p>

<div class="notice-box">
<strong>Scope:</strong>
Most Waynesboro council packets are scanned images. The five packets from June 15 to September 21, 2026 were read in full. For the twenty earlier 2025 and 2026 packets only pages 1 to 7 were read, by machine reading, which can miss words. About 400 attachment pages were not read. The Waynesboro agenda center lists no council agendas, packets or minutes dated 2023 or 2024. A listed name is a name as a record prints it, with surnames only where the record gives only surnames.
</div>

